      "value": "I agree, Streamer Mode should be a love child that blends privacy comfort controls with real broadcast control system.\n\nIdeally, Streamer Mode should have a configuration structure with independent controls for:\n\nchatboxes\n\nnames\n\nstatuses\n\nstickers\n\nemojis\n\nmenus/internal UI\n\nvideo player rendering\n\nvideo player audio\n\ncamera-specific audio behavior\n\nstream-camera-only visibility rules",
