  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Streamer mode is basically the saving grace for all VRChat streamers, but I have some qualms about how it works currently. Currently there seems to be no way to enable chatbox, instead it is always disabled for everyone with no option to enable a profanity filter instead and keep them shown. \n\nI use a dump button on my stream, which is a 3 second buffer that can catch any bad stuff ahead of time. Streamer mode should allow for reducing the amount of time I need to hit that dump button by being configurable. Of course it should block stickers, status, names and emojis too, but be ALL configurable.\n\nSmooth camera and the handheld camera should automatically not render the menu, last thing i wanna do is accidentally leak what my avatars im working on are or who is on my friends list. Make that an option too!\n\nVideo players should not run, stream safe for the sake of trolls so they cant link porn in the video players or play copyrighted music. Let me set the video players on or off locally optionally! (Because VR DJ's exist and some streamers will still use Videoplayers, but for us who dont wanna risk a ban cause someone played a song with a lot of explicatives or something..)\n\nStreamers are already aware of software and settings, so I'm putting in a vouch for more settings in streamer mode please. I don't even care if its like a JSON file honestly, just something.",
